==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Cherrim}} in its {{form|Cherrim|Sunshine Form}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Cherrim|7}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Cherrim|11}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*{{m|Leech Seed}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Cherrim}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

